{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-60","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447035286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"When is your turn to come?  \"Yes, I have had a letter from him by express.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-61","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447095286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It is every way horrible!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-62","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447155286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" cried Jane, \"what do you mean, sir?","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-63","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447215286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"After a short silence the lady first spoke.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-64","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447275286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It was not often that she could turn her eyes on Mr.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-65","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447335286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He meant to provide for me amply, and thought he had done it; but when the living fell, it was given elsewhere. Bingley was to bring twelve ladies and seven gentlemen with him to the assembly.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-66","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447395286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It is nothing in comparison of Rosings, my Lady, I dare say; but, I assure you, it is much larger than Sir William Lucas's.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-67","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447455286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bennet, for many years after Lydia's birth, had been certain that he would. Miss Bingley said something of his never returning to Netherfield again, of giving up the house, but not with any certainty.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-68","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447515286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He had not been long seated before he complimented Mrs. That he was not a good-tempered man had been her firmest opinion.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-69","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447575286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I am sick of them all.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-70","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447635286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bingley was everything that was charming, except the professed lover of her daughter.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-71","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447695286,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"A lively imagination soon settled it all.  \"The letter, perhaps, began in bitterness, but it did not end so.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18018708704-72","timestamp_unix_ms":1765447755286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"And how impossible in others!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
